{"title": "The Water Caller", "pageid": 28109, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/The_Water_Caller", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>The Water Caller</b> is a passive feature that produces water on hit with this weapon, soaking the target.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>On a hit, inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a> and create a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"2 m (7 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠2 m (7 ft) <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Water_(surface)\" title=\"Water (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Water_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Water_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Water_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Water_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Water_(surface)\" title=\"Water (surface)\">Water</a> surface centred around the target. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Wet\"> Condition: Wet </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic:_Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Wild Magic: Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Wild_Magic_Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Wi